<reference id="AddWindowForScheduleExportBACnet-511837FA" xml:lang="en" class="- topic/topic       reference/reference "><title class="- topic/title ">New (Edit) window for schedule export</title><shortdesc class="- topic/shortdesc ">This window configures a schedule for export.</shortdesc><prolog class="- topic/prolog "><metadata class="- topic/metadata "><keywords class="- topic/keywords "><indexterm class="- topic/indexterm ">New window<indexterm class="- topic/indexterm ">for schedule export</indexterm></indexterm></keywords></metadata></prolog><refbody class="- topic/body        reference/refbody "><section class="- topic/section "><fig id="ID-fig-00000030" class="- topic/fig "><title class="- topic/title ">New window in the Bacnet Schedule Export Manager</title><image placement="break" scale="65" href="../graphic/ClientScheduleExportAddDialog_0000044859.png" class="- topic/image "/></fig><p class="- topic/p ">This window opens when you expand <menucascade class="+ topic/ph ui-d/menucascade "><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Config</uicontrol><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Drivers</uicontrol><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">BacnetNetwork</uicontrol><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">BacnetDevice</uicontrol></menucascade>, right-click <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Schedules</uicontrol>, click <menucascade class="+ topic/ph ui-d/menucascade "><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Views</uicontrol><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Bacnet Schedule Export Manager</uicontrol></menucascade> and click <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">New</uicontrol> or select a row and click <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Edit</uicontrol> in the <wintitle class="+ topic/keyword ui-d/wintitle ">Bacnet Schedule Export Manager</wintitle>.</p></section><properties class="- topic/simpletable reference/properties "><prophead class="- topic/sthead      reference/prophead "><prop